  'Submitted code and internal access': '提交代码与内部访问',
  'The Judge worker executes submissions through the documented sandbox path. Production requires an operator-owned remote or rootless Docker endpoint with TLS, read-only client certificates, a shared workspace and a fixed seccomp policy. The development-only socket profile is not the production configuration.': 'Judge Worker 通过文档规定的沙箱路径执行提交。生产要求运维方负责的远程或 rootless Docker TLS 端点、只读客户端证书、共享工作区与固定 seccomp 策略。仅用于开发的 socket 配置不是生产配置。',
  'Internal access has additional boundaries: owner-scoped database access, deny-by-default Redis ACLs and authenticated service contracts. The gateway is not the sole authorization boundary. Operators still own network isolation, infrastructure hardening, runtime limits, patching and incident response.': '内部访问还有额外边界：按 Owner 限定数据库访问、默认拒绝的 Redis ACL，以及经过认证的服务契约。网关不是唯一授权边界。运维方仍负责网络隔离、基础设施加固、运行限制、补丁和事件响应。',
  'Data and optional model use': '数据与可选模型使用',
  'The self-hosting operator chooses data location and controls access, retention, backups and deletion policy. Self-hosting alone does not establish regulatory compliance.': '自托管运维方确定数据位置，管理访问、保留、备份和删除策略。仅凭自托管不能确立监管合规性。',
  'The optional Agent service keeps private conversation and workflow state separately from the business databases. Conversation history remains until the owner deletes it; saved learning plans have a separate lifecycle. Live model use and persistence have explicit deployment and authorization controls. Review external providers, per-run source-code consent, budgets and retention before enabling it for learners.': '可选 Agent 服务将私有对话与工作流状态独立于业务数据库保存。对话历史保留至所有者删除；已保存学习计划具有独立生命周期。真实模型调用与持久化有明确的部署和授权控制。面向学习者启用前，应审查外部提供方、逐次源码授权、预算和保留规则。',
  'Read the authentication and Agent reference': '阅读认证与 Agent 参考',
  'Review operator responsibilities': '查看运维方责任',
  'Report a concern without exposing it': '安全报告，避免公开暴露',
  'GitHub private vulnerability reporting was enabled when checked for the public repository on 23 October 2026. Use that channel to share a potential vulnerability privately with the repository’s maintainers.': '2026 年 10 月 23 日检查公开仓库时，GitHub 私密漏洞报告功能已启用。请通过该渠道向仓库维护者私密报告潜在漏洞。',
  'Keep exploit details and unpublished vulnerabilities out of public Issues and this website’s ordinary enquiry form.': '不要在公开 Issue 或本网站普通咨询表单中提交利用细节和未公开漏洞。',
  'Include only the information needed to explain and reproduce the concern, and remove credentials, student data and unrelated private material.': '仅提供解释和复现问题所需的信息，并移除凭据、学生数据和无关私密材料。',
  'Report a vulnerability privately on GitHub': '在 GitHub 私密报告漏洞',
  'GitHub sign-in may be required. Opening the link sends nothing until you submit the report. The project does not publish a security-response deadline.': '可能需要登录 GitHub。打开链接不会发送内容，提交报告后才会发送。项目未公布安全响应时限。',
  'Read GitHub’s private reporting guidance': '阅读 GitHub 私密报告指南',
