  'Community participation is welcome. There is no published support-response guarantee or governing foundation claimed by this website.': '欢迎社区参与。本网站没有公布支持响应保证，也未声称由某个基金会治理。',
  'Explore the GitHub repository': '浏览 GitHub 仓库',
  'Read the license': '阅读许可',
