  'Raise a security concern': '报告安全问题',
  'Use the': '请使用',
  'safe reporting guidance': '安全报告指南',
  '. Keep vulnerabilities and private information out of public Issues.': '。不要将漏洞与私人信息发布到公开 Issue。',
  'Search open and closed Issues first. GitHub Discussions is not enabled for this repository; Issues are the documented channel for questions and improvement proposals.': '请先搜索开放与已关闭的 Issue。此仓库未启用 GitHub Discussions；文档规定使用 Issue 提问与提出改进建议。',
  'Search project Issues': '搜索项目 Issue',
  'Make a contribution that can be reviewed': '提交便于审查的贡献',
  'Understand the scope.': '理解范围。',
  'Read the repository’s': '阅读仓库的',
  'contributor instructions': '贡献者说明',
  ', relevant directory guidance and authoritative documentation. Discuss larger changes in an Issue.': '、相关目录指南和权威文档。在 Issue 中讨论较大的改动。',
  'Make a focused change.': '保持改动聚焦。',
  'Follow existing conventions and preserve documented ownership, validation and security boundaries. Documentation fixes and clear reproductions are useful contributions too.': '遵循现有约定，保留文档明确的归属、校验与安全边界。文档修正和清晰复现同样是有价值的贡献。',
  'Verify the affected behavior.': '验证受影响行为。',
  'Follow the current development guide and run the matching repository checks. The README asks for behavior-change tests, and the appropriate gate.': '遵循当前开发指南并运行对应仓库检查。README 要求为行为改动提供测试并执行适用门禁。',
  'Follow the current development guide and run the matching repository checks. The README asks for behavior-change tests,': '遵循当前开发指南并运行对应仓库检查。README 要求为行为改动提供测试、',
