  'gate.': '门禁。',
  'Explain the result.': '说明最终结果。',
  'Open a pull request with the problem, final behavior, actual verification and known limits. Never include credentials, environment files, private keys, student records or generated runtime artifacts.': '创建拉取请求，说明问题、最终行为、实际验证与已知限制。绝不能包含凭据、环境文件、私钥、学生记录或生成的运行产物。',
  'Read the development guide': '阅读开发指南',
  'Browse pull requests': '浏览拉取请求',
  'Follow progress without assuming a promise': '了解进展，不将其视为承诺',
  'Issues describe problems and proposals; pull requests show work under review; merged source and verified releases show what shipped. A suggestion, open Issue or activity date is not a delivery commitment.': 'Issue 描述问题与建议；拉取请求展示审查中的工作；已合并源码和经过验证的发布说明已交付内容。建议、开放 Issue 或活动日期都不是交付承诺。',
  'Review project updates and release status': '查看项目更新与发布状态',
