  'Licensing': '许可',
  'Use the code with a clear view of the license': '了解许可，再使用代码',
  'Read the UltiCode MIT License and distinguish project source from third-party dependencies, problem content and student work.': '阅读 UltiCode MIT 许可，并区分项目源码、第三方依赖、题目内容与学生作品。',
  'The repository is MIT licensed': '仓库采用 MIT 许可',
  'The MIT License permits use, modification and distribution, including commercial use, subject to retaining the copyright and permission notice in copies or substantial portions of the software. The source is provided without warranty under the terms below.': 'MIT 许可允许使用、修改和分发，包括商业使用，但必须在软件副本或实质部分中保留版权与许可声明。源码按下列条款提供，不附带保证。',
  'Read the license in the pinned source': '阅读固定版本中的许可',
  'Check the current repository license': '查看仓库当前许可',
  'Review the materials you add': '审查您添加的材料',
  'Dependencies keep their own terms.': '依赖项保留各自条款。',
  'Review third-party packages, runtime images, fonts and other bundled assets for the distribution you intend to operate or redistribute.': '审查您计划运营或再分发的版本中的第三方包、运行镜像、字体及其他附带资源。',
  'Problem content needs its own permission.': '题目内容需要单独授权。',
  'A code license does not establish rights to every problem statement, test case, editorial or dataset you import.': '代码许可并不确立您导入的所有题面、测试用例、题解或数据集的权利。',
  'Student work remains a separate concern.': '学生作品需要单独考虑。',
