  'Public text is not automatic model consent.': '公开文本不等于自动同意模型使用。',
  'The architecture guide requires owned or explicitly authorized material for any future real retrieval corpus; public editorials do not automatically carry permission for model transmission or corpus reuse.': '架构指南要求未来真实检索语料使用自有或明确获授权的材料；公开题解不自动附带向模型传输或作为语料再使用的许可。',
  'This page identifies review areas and reproduces the repository license. It does not replace your institution’s legal or procurement review.': '本页列出评审领域并转载仓库许可，不能替代机构的法律或采购审查。',
