  'UltiCode source is MIT licensed. Understand the infrastructure, staff, security and optional model costs of operating it.': 'UltiCode 源码采用 MIT 许可。了解运营所需的基础设施、人力、安全和可选模型成本。',
  'Source code is available under MIT': '源码以 MIT 许可提供',
  'You can obtain UltiCode’s public source without purchasing a software subscription from this website. Usage and distribution remain subject to the': '您无需向本网站购买软件订阅即可获取 UltiCode 公开源码。使用和分发仍须遵守',
  'and any applicable third-party or content terms.': '以及适用的第三方或内容条款。',
  'This website does not offer a managed hosting plan, paid support tier, service-level agreement or procurement contract. No price, discount, free-service allowance or commercial commitment is implied.': '本网站不提供托管方案、付费支持等级、服务等级协议或采购合同，不暗示任何价格、折扣、免费服务额度或商业承诺。',
  'Get the source on GitHub': '在 GitHub 获取源码',
