  'Infrastructure': '基础设施',
  'Application services, isolated judging capacity, databases, object storage, queues, search, networking, backups and monitoring.': '应用服务、隔离评测容量、数据库、对象存储、队列、搜索、网络、备份与监控。',
  'Operations': '运营维护',
  'Deployment, upgrades, certificate and secret rotation, recovery rehearsals, incident response and ongoing support.': '部署、升级、证书与密钥轮换、恢复演练、事件响应与持续支持。',
  'Institutional review': '机构评审',
  'Security, privacy, accessibility, content licensing, identity integration and any required local changes.': '安全、隐私、无障碍、内容许可、身份集成与必要的本地改动。',
  'Optional model services': '可选模型服务',
  'Only if enabled: provider charges, per-run limits, budget controls and review of external data processing.': '仅在启用时考虑：提供方费用、单次运行限制、预算控制与外部数据处理审查。',
  'Estimate from your expected workload and measured pilot results. The project does not publish a verified per-student price, concurrency allowance or minimum production hardware size here.': '请根据预期工作负载与实测试点结果估算。项目在此不发布经过验证的每学生价格、并发额度或最低生产硬件规模。',
  'Plan a bounded pilot': '规划有限范围的试点',
  'Review operating responsibilities': '查看运营责任',
  'Product boundary': '产品边界',
  'Contact': '联系',
  'Bring your project questions.': '带着项目问题来交流。',
  'Send an enquiry to the site owner, manage your saved requests or use the public GitHub project channel.': '向站点所有者咨询、管理已保存请求，或使用公开 GitHub 项目渠道。',
  'Reach the project through GitHub Issues': '通过 GitHub Issue 联系项目',
  'The public repository documents Issues as the channel for questions, problem reports and improvement discussions. An Issue reaches the project’s real public tracker; it does not establish an email help desk, a support contract or a response deadline.': '公开仓库规定使用 Issue 提问、报告问题与讨论改进。Issue 会进入真实的公开项目跟踪系统，但不构成邮件服务台、支持合同或响应时限。',
  'Browse existing Issues': '浏览已有 Issue',
  'Describe an institutional evaluation': '描述机构评估需求',
  'For a pilot conversation, briefly describe the intended teaching or practice workflow, whether you expect to self-host, and the deployment or identity questions that need an answer. Share only information appropriate for a public repository.': '讨论试点时，请简要描述预期教学或练习工作流、是否计划自托管，以及需要解答的部署或身份问题。仅分享适合公开仓库的信息。',
  'Draft an evaluation question on GitHub': '在 GitHub 起草评估问题',
