  'The enquiry form needs JavaScript. You can still use the public GitHub channel, taking care not to post private information.': '咨询表单需要 JavaScript。您仍可使用公开 GitHub 渠道，请注意不要发布私人信息。',
  'Keep private material out of the public tracker': '不要在公开跟踪系统提交私密材料',
