  'Read the reporting guidance': '阅读报告指引',
  'before sharing details.': '后再分享细节。',
  'If you follow a GitHub link, any information you submit there is handled by GitHub and the public repository’s participants. Review where your message will be delivered before sending it.': '通过 GitHub 链接提交的信息由 GitHub 和公开仓库参与者处理。发送前请确认消息的接收位置。',
