  'Find help and contribution guidance': '查看帮助与贡献指南',
  'Documented contact and contribution channel': '文档规定的联系与贡献渠道',
  'Evaluation protocol': '评估协议',
  'An evaluation you can reproduce': '可复现的评估流程',
  'A practical self-hosted evaluation with source references, responsibilities, acceptance criteria and a clear exit decision.': '实用的自托管评估流程，包含源码参考、职责、验收标准与明确的结束决策。',
  'Start with the available service model': '从当前可用的服务模式开始',
  'UltiCode is available as MIT-licensed source for self-hosted evaluation. Your team supplies infrastructure, permitted test data and an operator. The public project provides code, guides and community issue tracking; this website does not sell a managed pilot or reserve implementation time.': 'UltiCode 以 MIT 许可源码提供，可供自托管评估。您的团队提供基础设施、允许使用的测试数据和运维人员。公开项目提供代码、指南与社区问题跟踪；本网站不出售托管试点，也不预留实施工时。',
  'No software subscription is required to obtain the source. Infrastructure, staff time and any enabled external model calls remain your costs. A separate service arrangement exists only if you and a provider actually agree one.': '获取源码无需软件订阅。基础设施、人力时间和已启用的外部模型调用费用仍由您承担。只有您与服务提供方实际达成约定，才存在单独的服务安排。',
