  'Stage': '阶段',
  'Action': '行动',
  'Keep as evidence': '应保留的证据',
  'Agree scope': '约定范围',
  'Choose one ordinary-practice workflow and synthetic or authorized data. Name the teaching sponsor, operator and decision owner.': '选择一个普通练习工作流及合成或获授权的数据。明确教学发起人、运维人员和决策负责人。',
  'Revision, permitted data, responsibilities, evaluation window and success criteria.': '版本、允许使用的数据、职责、评估时间窗口与成功标准。',
  'Prepare': '准备',
  'Follow the environment, object storage and migration gates. Use the supported lifecycle scripts.': '遵循环境、对象存储与迁移门禁。使用受支持的生命周期脚本。',
  'Sanitized doctor results, completed migration records and selected scope. Never substitute a changed marker for a completed cutover.': '脱敏的 doctor 结果、已完成迁移记录和选定范围。绝不能用修改标记代替已完成切换。',
  'Exercise': '执行验证',
  'Use a normal learner account to open a known problem, submit correct and incorrect solutions, and inspect final results. Check administrator restrictions separately.': '使用普通学习者账号打开已知题目，提交正确与错误解答并检查最终结果。单独检查管理员权限限制。',
  'Problem and language configuration, submission identifiers, expected and actual results, and authorization outcomes.': '题目与语言配置、提交标识、预期和实际结果，以及授权检查结果。',
  'Operate': '运行维护',
  'Check monitoring and an approved recovery rehearsal on an isolated target. Measure your representative workload.': '检查监控，并在隔离目标上开展获准的恢复演练。测量具有代表性的工作负载。',
